Dialogue: 10,0:00:07.44,0:00:10.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Miss Cecil? May?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.01,0:00:11.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But why...?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.35,0:00:15.49,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're here to bring you back home, Mariabell.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.30,0:00:19.16,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How did you two get here?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.61,0:00:21.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, about that...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.23,0:00:23.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Meddling in my affairs...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.73,0:00:26.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When Hinata and I were this close to...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.92,0:00:29.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was so close...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.92,0:00:31.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Unacceptable...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.63,0:00:33.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tears of blood?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.63,0:00:33.59,Subtitle-Alt,,0,0,0,,Unforgiveable...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.87,0:00:38.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I stepped in to save Lord Hinata\Nbecause you were about to pounce on him.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.09,0:00:39.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.75,0:00:41.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, calm down, ladies!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.50,0:00:42.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,May?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.18,0:00:44.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry for barging in on you.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.23,0:00:48.07,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I think we oughtta move our reunion\Nsomewhere more private.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.23,0:00:45.92,Subtitle-Alt,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.92,0:00:48.07,Subtitle-Alt,,0,0,0,,Are they filming a TV drama?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.07,0:00:49.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A fight scene?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.34,0:00:52.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good idea. Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:57.45,0:01:59.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's nice to see you again, Miss Cecil.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:59.78,0:02:00.80,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.80,0:02:03.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I'm glad you're doing well, May.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:03.00,0:02:04.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sure am, thanks!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:05.75,0:02:08.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Miss Cecil is a priestess who\Nserves the gods,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:08.67,0:02:11.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and May is a demi-human girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.18,0:02:12.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the coffee.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:12.93,0:02:16.57,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh, so this is what our\Nlittle Hinata's house looks like!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:16.57,0:02:20.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,First you show up uninvited, then you crash\Nmine and Hinata's sacred love nest?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.18,0:02:21.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The audacity!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:21.81,0:02:26.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lord Hinata said that this would be\Nthe best place for us to chat uninterrupted.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:26.76,0:02:30.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Besides, whose fault is it that we're\Neven in this situation to begin with?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:30.96,0:02:32.61,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What situation?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:32.61,0:02:37.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea the chaos you've caused\Nby coming here all willy-nilly?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.17,0:02:38.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:39.24,0:02:43.31,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The existence of the other world\Nwas once meant to be a secret.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.31,0:02:45.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If it were to become widespread knowledge,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:45.79,0:02:49.60,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we don't know how our two worlds\Nmight influence each other.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.88,0:02:53.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We were dispatched on government orders
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.21,0:02:56.49,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,to retrieve you before something\Ngoes horribly wrong.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.49,0:02:58.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.11,0:03:02.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I really was rooting\Nfor the two of you.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.28,0:03:03.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you leave now,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.98,0:03:06.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you'll be pardoned due to your\Ncommendable victory over the Demon Lord.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.94,0:03:08.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So come quietly—
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.12,0:03:09.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.43,0:03:12.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This whole thing is a plot to try and\Nseparate me and Hinata, isn't it?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.70,0:03:14.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your tricks won't work on me!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.37,0:03:17.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She didn't listen to a single thing I said!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.03,0:03:18.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C-Can't breathe...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.72,0:03:20.49,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can't have him!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.49,0:03:21.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-Bell?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.92,0:03:24.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata and I are destined to be together!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.38,0:03:28.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone tear us apart.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.71,0:03:30.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's the only thing I need.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.59,0:03:32.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The government or an entire world...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.59,0:03:35.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I won't tolerate anything\Nthat stands in our way.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.93,0:03:38.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see. That settles it, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.72,0:03:40.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're going to leave us alone?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.26,0:03:45.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No. If I can't convince you,\Nthen I'll have to use force.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.11,0:03:47.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wha— Miss Cecil, take it easy!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.98,0:03:50.20,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fine...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.86,0:03:55.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was never a big fan of yours\Nin the first place.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.63,0:03:57.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Always poking your nose in\Nother people's business...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.75,0:04:00.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What, do you really hate dark elves that much?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.84,0:04:02.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.58,0:04:07.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In fact, I have a lot of respect for\Ndark elves and their virtuous mentality.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.42,0:04:08.77,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.77,0:04:10.35,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that excludes you.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.60,0:04:14.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You and that humongous ass of yours\Nhave some nerve!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.25,0:04:15.10,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How about we take this outside?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.38,0:04:16.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fine by me.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.46,0:04:20.57,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your big boobs and even bigger mouth are\Nlong overdue for a good humbling, anyway.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.57,0:04:22.14,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-You guys...!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.14,0:04:25.35,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They really go for each other's throats\Nwhen they fight!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.35,0:04:28.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I came with Cecil 'cause I wanted to\Nsee this play out!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.29,0:04:30.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, no! We have to stop them!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.19,0:04:32.66,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I couldn't if I tried!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.02,0:04:35.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Today's the day we settle this\Nonce and for all!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.76,0:04:37.30,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was just about to say that.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.30,0:04:41.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Though I hope you won't regret\Nhumiliating yourself in front of Lord Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.34,0:04:43.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-What do we do?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.00,0:04:44.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Didja forget, Hinata?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.33,0:04:48.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How you used to stop 'em\Nwhen they got in an argument?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.00,0:04:53.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe if someone were to\Nget down on his knees...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.46,0:04:58.44,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Everyone stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.57,0:05:03.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Cecil, May, I get why you\Ntraveled to this world.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.61,0:05:07.86,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know the risks of Bell being here.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.95,0:05:12.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was also really confused when she\Nshowed up in my apartment.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.91,0:05:14.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.01,0:05:16.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,During my time with Bell,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.00,0:05:19.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I realized that there are people here\Nwho will accept her for who she is.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.65,0:05:24.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And more than anything, the fact that\Nshe came here to visit me...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.66,0:05:28.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It made me really happy!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.49,0:05:30.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.67,0:05:33.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, but if something were to happen...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.39,0:05:36.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If something goes wrong,\NI'll take responsibility for it.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.75,0:05:38.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So please, let her stay!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.68,0:05:45.68,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, Cecil? Whaddya think?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.89,0:05:49.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't stand a chance against Lord Hinata...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.11,0:05:51.69,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Alright then.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.69,0:05:55.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Out of respect for Lord Hinata,\NI will withhold my judgment for now.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.52,0:05:57.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.91,0:06:00.69,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But do keep a few things in mind:
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.69,0:06:03.31,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If something were to go wrong,\Nit would put us in danger,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.31,0:06:06.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and it could very well pose a threat\Nto Lord Hinata, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.51,0:06:09.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's crucial that you remain as inconspicuous\Nas possible by using your discretion and—
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.97,0:06:12.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Cecil, you're rambling again!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.34,0:06:17.27,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.63,0:06:19.73,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well then, we'll be going now.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.73,0:06:21.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,See ya later!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.07,0:06:25.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? Where are you going?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.47,0:06:27.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Seeing that we've reached\Na temporary agreement,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.78,0:06:31.10,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,there's no reason for us\Nto hang around here.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.10,0:06:33.27,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's been so long since we\Nlast saw each other.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.27,0:06:35.66,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're welcome to stay and relax...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.66,0:06:39.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, as much as we'd like to...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.00,0:06:43.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can't afford to linger in\Nthis world for very long.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.04,0:06:44.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's too bad...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.41,0:06:46.80,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.80,0:06:50.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,to interfere any further would put\Nour physical safety at risk.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.12,0:06:52.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Physical safety"...?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.95,0:06:56.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lord Hinata... may the gods protect you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.17,0:06:58.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.39,0:07:00.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okey-dokey, good luck!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.50,0:07:04.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Good luck"...?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.80,0:07:07.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.07,0:07:12.30,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Bell?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.85,0:07:15.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.93,0:07:18.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For sticking up for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.01,0:07:20.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was really happy to hear...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.67,0:07:23.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that you want me here.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.44,0:07:26.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.53,0:07:29.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And "taking responsibility"?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.08,0:07:33.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I had no idea you were giving so much\Nthought to our future together...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.78,0:07:34.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,H-Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.21,0:07:39.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you're that serious about us,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.42,0:07:42.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,then there's no need for me\Nto hold anything back, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.04,0:07:44.06,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"H-Hold back"...?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.06,0:07:46.65,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't hold back, either.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.65,0:07:48.32,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wha— Bell!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.60,0:07:50.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Quit it!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.18,0:07:54.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hi-na-ta...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.25,0:08:00.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Playing hard to get?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.33,0:08:02.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you into that kind of thing?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.37,0:08:05.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,N-No, I... Calm down, Bell!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.87,0:08:09.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've stayed calm for too long!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.17,0:08:12.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You said... you'd take responsibility, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.20,0:08:17.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata, look at me...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.12,0:08:21.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is the lingerie you\Nbought for me the other day!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.88,0:08:25.81,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have a lot to learn from you\Nin this new world, Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.13,0:08:28.60,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can keep going 'cause I've got you.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.60,0:08:31.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You and I are destined to be together!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.72,0:08:34.07,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know you'll step up to the plate...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.89,0:08:37.73,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you want me, Hinata...?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.31,0:08:43.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Remember when you said\NI had beautiful skin?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.58,0:08:45.56,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look at it some more...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.43,0:08:53.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can't do this... We aren't...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.97,0:08:55.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Feeling shy?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.51,0:08:58.35,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How adorable!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.21,0:09:00.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So soft...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.54,0:09:03.73,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can you feel my heart pounding?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.73,0:09:05.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I belong to you, Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.75,0:09:07.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Touch me however you like.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.76,0:09:16.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Today's going to be the day, Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.70,0:09:23.73,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's have an in-depth conversation\Nabout our future tonight.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.73,0:09:25.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All night long...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.61,0:09:27.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,'Kay?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.25,0:09:31.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's embarrassing if I'm the only one\Nwho's naked. Take this off...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.99,0:09:33.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.70,0:09:36.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your skin is beautiful, too, Hinata...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.63,0:09:47.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can't forget down here...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.21,0:09:50.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why don't we say hello to mini-Hinata?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.07,0:09:56.86,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What in the hell...?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.81,0:10:02.81,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,May the gods protect you.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.16,0:10:08.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Cecil, you bitch!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.96,0:10:11.40,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.27,0:10:15.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Dammit! The mood is ruined...!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.28,0:10:18.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-That was a close one...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.93,0:10:27.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tsk, and after I managed to get\Nso close last night...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.17,0:10:29.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're still upset about that?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.22,0:10:35.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who could that be this early in the morning...?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.51,0:10:38.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.18,0:10:40.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,G'morning, you two!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.15,0:10:41.26,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.70,0:10:43.95,Subtitle-Arial-1,,0,0,0,,For You
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.40,0:10:47.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Starting today, we'll be your\Nnext-door neighbors.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.19,0:10:49.95,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We look forward to getting to know you.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.95,0:10:51.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-But why...?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.96,0:10:56.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We've been instructed to keep an eye on you\Nin case something goes wrong...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.12,0:10:57.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,per government orders.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.24,0:10:59.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This'll be fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.28,0:11:03.74,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,GO HOME!
